#: models.py:23
msgid "Display Name:"
msgstr "Weergavenaam:"

#: models.py:26
msgid "This name appears in the horizontal navigation at the top of the page."
msgstr "Deze naam verschijnt in de horizontale navigatie bovenaan de pagina."

#: models.py:29
msgid "Link Text:"
msgstr "Verbind tekst:"

#: models.py:32
msgid "This is the text that will link to your survey."
msgstr "Dit is de tekst die naar uw enquête linkt."

#: models.py:35
msgid "Message:"
msgstr "Bericht:"

#: models.py:38
msgid "This is the text that will be displayed above the link to your survey."
msgstr "Dit is de tekst die boven de link naar uw enquête wordt weergegeven."

#: models.py:41
msgid "Extra Parameters:"
msgstr "Extra parameters:"

#: models.py:45
msgid ""
"Additional query parameters to include in the survey URL. Format: "
"key1=value1&key2=value2. If blank, no extra parameters are added."
msgstr ""
"Aanvullende queryparameters die moeten worden opgenomen in de enquête-URL. "
"Formaat: key1=value1&key2=value2. Indien leeg, worden er geen extra "
"parameters toegevoegd."

#: models.py:51
msgid "Survey ID:"
msgstr "Enquête-ID:"

#: models.py:55
msgid ""
"This is the ID that Qualtrics uses for the survey, which can include numbers"
" and letters, and should be entered in the following format: "
"SV_###############"
msgstr ""
"Dit is de ID die Qualtrics gebruikt voor de enquête, die cijfers en letters "
"kan bevatten, en moet in de volgende notatie worden ingevoerd: "
"SV_##############"

#: models.py:61
msgid "Your University:"
msgstr "Jouw universiteit:"

#: models.py:65
msgid ""
"The subdomain for your university's Qualtrics account "
"(e.g.'stanforduniversity'). If left blank, the system-wide default is used."
msgstr ""
"Het subdomein voor het Qualtrics-account van je universiteit (bijv. "
"'stanforduniversity'). Indien leeg gelaten, wordt de systeemwijde standaard "
"gebruikt."
